<title>UK: SGA sets calls on Holderbank bearer shares.</title>
<headline>SGA sets calls on Holderbank bearer shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Holderbank bearer shares, lead manager Societe Generale Bank &amp; Trust Zurich said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1150 CHF		  PREMIUM	13.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.70 CHF		  GEARING	8.4 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	09.APR.99		 PAYDATE	02.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1135 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
